# The vélôToulouse app's built-in key and the JCDecaux station-feed key (40 characters),
# both read from a capture of the app (docs/api.md in Androlax2/velobook-toulouse).
# Either can stay empty and be set from velobook's Settings page instead.
VELO_APP_KEY=
VELO_JCDECAUX_KEY=
# Tailscale auth key for velobook's own node (admin console, Settings > Keys). Used once: the
# node then keeps its identity in ${DOCKERCONFDIR}/velobook-tailscale. Disable key expiry on the
# node afterwards.
TS_AUTHKEY=
